<section xml:id="sec-linear-regression-tool">
    <title>Linear Regression Tool</title>
    <note>
        <title>Zoom Issues</title>
        <p>The author is aware the text and images in this tool are very small. 
            Fortunately, the tool scales well, so you can zoom in to make it easier to read. The author is working on a solution to this issue.
            The recommended zoom level is 150%.</p>
    </note>
    <figure xml:id="fig-linear-regression-tool">
        <caption>The Linear Regression Tool created in GeoGebra</caption>
        <interactive geogebra="epr8jb4h" material-width="967" material-height="759" toolbar="yes" reset-icon="yes"/>
    </figure>
</section>